Production and quality — processes, evidence and continuing control (@production-quality-map: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @hephaestus, #making-and-maintenance "clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control/Clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control.lingua#r_7D8SQ8BVQDZQBDBGC6DP0JAMZN") { r_2Y7YR9YHGPS7CWXQ7R4SAJVBR4
Understand how a process produces a useful result repeatedly, how evidence establishes its condition, and how people and equipment maintain that result through change.

[Clean manufacturing and contamination control](clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control/Clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control.lingua#r_7D8SQ8BVQDZQBDBGC6DP0JAMZN) begins with particles, chemical residues, microbial material and shared quantities. Sampling, calibration and simple transport/removal balances lead into three investigations of sensitive surfaces, air samples and aseptic process boundaries. Particle transport now develops corrected drag and mobility, Brownian and electrical motion, coagulation and population balances, collecting boundaries and turbulent transport. An inspectable settling/diffusion calculation and three further investigations deepen the physical account. Surface formation now develops adhesion and contact models, roughness, charge, wetting, capillary forces, removal modes and surface storage through three further investigations. Cleaning chemistry now connects residue analysis, solution equilibria, colloids, compatibility and removal methods to rinse balances, drying and preservation. Three further investigations examine residue identification, rinse systems and fragile manufactured structures. Facility studies now connect layout, barriers, people, filtration and fan behavior to pressure/contaminant networks, transfers, thermal conditions, utility dependencies and control. Three further investigations examine installed air cleaning, pressure/transfer boundaries and energy/control together. Aerosol measurement now develops sampling paths, instrument responses, count statistics, calibration and inverse inference through three further investigations. Surface measurement connects imaging, chemical evidence and film inference. Qualification and monitoring now develop operating domains, sampling decisions, control charts, dependent observations and change investigation through three further studies. Specialist processes, continuing operation and final research remain in development; the subject root records a deferred sensitive-data TODO for specialist microbial laboratory methods.

Related work continues through [Engineering](../engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68), [Resources and materials](../materials/Materials.lingua#r_14HP6K610XB12E2WGNK9A6VN8D), [Utilities](../utilities/Utilities.lingua#r_23Z5YYXGRA1JDFD4BAM955JMNX), [Hephaestus](../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001) and [Philosophy](../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001).

[Development scope: Production and quality](../../../lince/Trails.lingua#r_3YPJC2P8KN1G137NF9WXVQACRZ).
